# ShellCheck settings for scripts/tests/ (task mg4).
#
# ShellCheck uses the nearest .shellcheckrc only, so this file keeps
# scripts/.shellcheckrc's check-set-e-suppressed away from the tests. In a
# test, helpers called under if/||/&& are the assertions themselves and
# every outcome is checked explicitly; flagging them (about 150 sites)
# would be noise. The top-level *-e2e harnesses follow the same policy with
# a file-wide "disable=SC2310" directive.
#
# Default checks still apply. Empty on purpose: no optional checks.
